      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. to make it more \"persuasive\" for a debate setting, i want to lean into the idea that these regions were basically disorganized or incapable of large-scale modernization without that external push. how can i frame the argument that the \"structure\" provided by colonial powers helped correct for a lack of domestic administrative capacity? i want to suggest that without these systems, these nations might have struggled with even more instability or failed to enter the global market altogether.",
